9	
10	Introduces ⁠` RetentionSizeInPercent ⁠` and
11	⁠` LocalRetentionSizeInPercent ⁠` JMX metrics to express partition
12	storage as a percentage of configured retention limits. No existing
13	metrics or behavior are changed.
14	
15	This PR implements [KIP-1257: Partition Size Percentage Metrics for
16	Storage
17	
18	Monitoring](https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1257%3A+Partition+Size+Percentage+Metrics+for+Storage+Monitoring).
19	
20	JMX Metric names
21	```
22	kafka.log.remote:type=RemoteLogManager,name=RetentionSizeInPercent,topic=<topic>,partition=<partition>
23	kafka.log.remote:type=RemoteLogManager,name=LocalRetentionSizeInPercent,topic=<topic>,partition=<partition>
24	```
25	
26	Testing
27	
28	•⁠  ⁠Unit tests covering percentage calculations and edge cases  •⁠
29	⁠Tests for zero and negative (unlimited) retention configurations  •⁠
30	⁠Tests for metric lifecycle (registration, update, cancellation)  •⁠
31	⁠Tests verifying metrics are reset on task cancellation
